{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-air-heater-2601-0300","content_id":"36970b65-90c4-40ef-9977-42e680dbdce6","description":"Product Safety Report for Air Heater presenting a high risk of fire.","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"a62a2a37-d56c-49b2-94b6-c6134b624235","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-04-30T14:17:14+01:00","id":"a62a2a37-d56c-49b2-94b6-c6134b624235","title":"Link to product image and PDF ","updated_at":"2026-04-30T14:17:14+01:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69f356594b0f7395324fbb77/2601-0300-product-safety-report-air-heater.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: Air Heater</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The product presents a high risk of fire because it has poor quality internal soldering and may not operate safely under fault conditions.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The product has been destroyed</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Electrical appliances and equipment - Air Heaters - Portable</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Brand</td>\n      <td>PTC Heating (packaging only)</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Model</td>\n      <td>BG-EH12</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Barcode</td>\n      <td>X002DBFAHZ</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>China</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>White air heater with wall plug.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_a62a2a37-d56c-49b2-94b6-c6134b624235\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69f356594b0f7395324fbb77/2601-0300-product-safety-report-air-heater.pdf\">Link to product image and PDF </a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The product presents a high risk of fire because it has poor quality internal soldering and may not operate safely under fault conditions. The plug is also considered counterfeit and has a fuse without any ballast. The ballast is required to ensure the safe operation of the fuse under fault conditions, and its absence could lead to the plug overheating and/or exploding.</p>\n\n<p>The product does not meet the requirements of the Electrical Equipment (Safety) Regulations 2016 or the Plugs &amp; Sockets (Safety) Regulations 1994.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The product has been destroyed</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD notification number: 2601-0300</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Local Authority Trading Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-05-01T09:37:05Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-safety-report","product_category":"electrical-appliances-equipment","product_measure_type":["destruction-of-the-product"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2026-05-01","product_risk_level":"high"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2026-05-01T10:37:05+01:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-air-heater-2601-0300","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-air-heater-2601-0300","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-air-heater-2601-030